for modal/auxiliary phrases, pronouns, contractions, citations, and discourse
punctuation. Conversation and tool markers have separate values. Remember only
the preceding token, resetting it at document changes. These rules explained
little activation variance; most idiosyncratic content-word effects remain at
an almost-zero baseline rather than receiving an arbitrary vocabulary lookup.
