    complete_word = last_word(tail) if raw and raw[-1].isalpha() else last_word(raw)
    return (doc, complete_word, tail), float(value)

"""A spelling detector for cl, strongest on unfinished syllables/abbreviations.
Completed common cl words are weaker. The Cyrillic кл, Korean 클 and
Katakana クラ/クリ/クル/クレ/クロ are treated as related spellings.
A following alphabetic continuation inherits a small negative response.
